    "created_at": "2022-12-16T13:31:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-16T13:31:13Z",
    "body": "> The evidence in this issue indicates that GitHub Pages is apparently performing as you say it may, and it breaks Firefox's ability to navigate to certain websites hosted on that server.\r\n\r\nI don't think it does? Browsers that do not behave like Firefox (and Safari behaves like Firefox so something changed since OP) would not be able to visit the 404 at `https://jsdom.github.io/wh%61twg-url/` as they would instead get the resource at `https://jsdom.github.io/whatwg-url/` which is different.\r\n\r\nI'm going to treat this as a clarification issue as per https://github.com/whatwg/url/issues/606#issuecomment-930109895. PRs welcome.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
